<title>GERMANY: Degussa says 95/96 net profit rose 1 pct.</title>
<headline>Degussa says 95/96 net profit rose 1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Business year ended Sept 30 1996 (in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   302     vs 298</p>
<p>    Result according to DVFA/SG	    333     vs 324</p>
<p>    Dividend (already reported)	    13 dmk  vs 12.50 dmk</p>
<p>Earnings per share</p>
<p>    (DVFA, already reported)		 39 dmk  vs 38 dmk</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German chemicals group is Degussa AG. Degussa already reported its core figures in December</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
